e exact service name.",[44,492,493,494,497,498,501,502,505],{},"Answer: ",[48,495,496],{},"country [countryId] | $price | N in stock",". When the id is not exact, a list of similar services\n(",[48,499,500],{},"Did you mean: …",") instead. Error ",[48,503,504],{},"ERROR_NO_SERVICE"," when nothing matches.",[113,507,510],{"className":508,"code":509,"language":118,"meta":119},[116],"Countries for google [google] (2), most stock first:\n  United Kingdom [44] | $0.20 | 100 in stock\n  Russia [7] | $0.30 | 100 in stock\n",[48,511,509],{"__ignoreMap":119},[385,513,194],{"id":194},[44,515,516,517,519],{},"The cheapest in-stock countries of a service — use it instead of guessing a ",[48,518,72],{},". Read-only.",[132,521,522,534],{},[135,523,524],{},[138,525,526,528,530,532],{},[141,527,398],{},[141,529,401],{},[141,531,404],{},[141,533,407],{},[151,535,536,552],{},[138,537,538,542,544,546],{},[156,539,540],{},[48,541,64],{},[156,543,419],{},[156,545,482],{},[156,547,548,487,550,89],{},[48,549,64],{},[48,551,164],{},[138,553,554,559,562,564],{},[156,555,556],{},[48,557,558],{},"limit",[156,560,561],{},"integer",[156,563,422],{},[156,565,566],{},"1–20, default 5.",[44,568,569,570,572,573,575],{},"Answer: like ",[48,571,180],{},", sorted by price. Suggestions or ",[48,574,504],{}," the same way.",[385,577,208],{"id":208},[44,579,580],{},"Every Quick SMS country (directory, no prices). No arguments. Read-only.",[44,582,493,583,586,587,589,590,592],{},[48,584,585],{},"name · countryId [code] · on|off",". The ",[48,588,72],{}," is the country's dial code. For prices and stock use a\n",[48,591,64],{}," with the two tools above.",[385,594,222],{"id":222},[44,596,597],{},"The long-term rental catalog. No arguments. Read-only.",[44,599,600,601,604,605,608,609,612],{},"Answer: per country ",[48,602,603],{},"name [rentalId] | in stock | OUT OF STOCK",", and per rent period ",[48,606,607],{},"N day(s) | $price | in stock",".\nCountries marked ",[48,610,611],{},"charged at once, no refund"," (e.g. US) are charged when rented instead of on the first SMS.",[113,614,617],{"className":615,"code":616,"language":118,"meta":119},[116],"Long-term SMS rental numbers (keep the same receive-only number for days):\n  russia [7] | in stock\n    1 day(s) | $1.00 | in stock\n    3 day(s) | $2.50 | in stock\n    7 day(s) | $5.00 | in stock\n",[48,618,616],{"__ignoreMap":119},[105,620,621],{"id":239},"Account",[385,623,236],{"id":236},[44,625,626],{},"No arguments. Read-only.",[44,628,629,630,633],{},"Answer: available for orders (= balance − frozen), total balance, frozen ",[48,631,632],{},"zbalance"," (reserved by open orders and\nunconfirmed rentals), income when the account has it, and the top-up link.",[113,635,638],{"className":636,"code":637,"language":118,"meta":119},[116],"Available for orders: $7.50\nAccount balance: $10.00\nFrozen (zbalance, reserved by open orders\u002Frentals): $2.50\n",[48,639,637],{"__ignoreMap":119},[105,641,254],{"id":642},"quick-sms",[385,644,251],{"id":251},[44,646,647,648,652],{},"Buy a number for one service. ",[649,650,651],"strong",{},"Spends balance",": the price is reserved at once and refunded if the order is closed\nwithout an SMS.",[132,654,655,667],{},[135,656,657],{},[138,658,659,661,663,665],{},[141,660,398],{},[141,662,401],{},[141,664,404],{},[141,666,407],{},[151,668,669,685],{},[138,670,671,675,677,679],{},[156,672,673],{},[48,674,64],{},[156,676,419],{},[156,678,482],{},[156,680,681,682,684],{},"Exact ",[48,683,64],{}," from the catalog.",[138,686,687,691,693,695],{},[156,688,689],{},[48,690,72],{},[156,692,561],{},[156,694,482],{},[156,696,697,487,699,73,701,89],{},[48,698,72],{},[48,700,180],{},[48,702,194],{},[44,704,493,705,708],{},[48,706,707],{},"Order ID: [tzid]",", the phone number, service, country, and the cancel guard.",[113,710,713],{"className":711,"code":712,"language":118,"meta":119},[116],"Quick SMS number ordered (price reserved on the balance).\nOrder ID: [1]\nPhone number (use this on the target service): +7900000001\nService: telegram | Country: 7\n",[48,714,712],{"__ignoreMap":119},[44,716,717,718,720,721,429,724,429,726,729,730,733,734,737,738,429,741,429,744,729,747,89],{},"Errors: ",[48,719,380],{}," (try another country), ",[48,722,723],{},"WARNING_LOW_BALANCE",[48,725,504],{},[48,727,728],{},"UNDEFINED_COUNTRY",",\n",[48,731,732],{},"EXCEEDED_CONCURRENT_OPERATIONS"," (too many open numbers without SMS), ",[48,735,736],{},"INTERVAL_CONCURRENT_REQUESTS_ERROR",",\nsubscription accounts: ",[48,739,740],{},"COUNTRY_NOT_ALLOWED",[48,742,743],{},"SUBSCRIPTION_ERR_SERVICE",[48,745,746],{},"SUBSCRIPTION_WRONG_ACTIVE_PACKAGE_ID",[48,748,749],{},"NO_ACTIVE_PACKAGE",[385,751,267],{"id":267},[44,753,754],{},"Wait for one order until it has an SMS, ends, or the timeout passes. Read-only: it never closes the order and never\nmoves it to the next SMS, so a later check or wait shows the same messages. The user must already have requested the\nSMS on the target site.",[132,756,757,769],{},[135,758,759],{},[138,760,761,763,765,767],{},[141,762,398],{},[141,764,401],{},[141,766,404],{},[141,768,407],{},[151,770,771,787],{},[138,772,773,778,780,782],{},[156,774,775],{},[48,776,777],{},"orderId",[156,779,561],{},[156,781,482],{},[156,783,784,785,89],{},"Order ID from ",[48,786,251],{},[138,788,789,794,796,798],{},[156,790,791],{},[48,792,793],{},"timeoutSecs",[156,795,561],{},[156,797,422],{},[156,799,800],{},"5–60, default 45. The order is polled every ~5 s.",[44,802,803],{},"Answer, one of:",[805,806,807,818,824,837],"ul",{},[808,809,810,813,814,817],"li",{},[649,811,812],{},"received"," — the messages, the code found in them (",[48,815,816],{},"Code: 123456",") and the number of polls;",[808,819,820,823],{},[649,821,822],{},"timeout"," — the order is still open; wait again or check later;",[808,825,826,829,830,429,833,836],{},[649,827,828],{},"ended"," — the order finished or failed without an SMS (",[48,831,832],{},"TZ_OVER_OK",[48,834,835],{},"ERROR_NO_ITEMS",");",[808,838,839,842],{},[649,840,841],{},"not found"," — not an active order of this account.",[44,844,845,846,849,850,429,853,855],{},"Rate limits (",[48,847,848],{},"TRY_AGAIN_LATER",", HTTP 429), ",[48,851,852],{},"ERROR_UNDEFINED",[48,854,736],{}," and network errors are\nretried until the timeout. At most 4 waits run at the same time.",[385,857,281],{"id":281},[44,859,860],{},"The inbox of one or more orders, one API call. Read-only.",[132,862,863,875],{},[135,864,865],{},[138,866,867,869,871,873],{},[141,868,398],{},[141,870,401],{},[141,872,404],{},[141,874,407],{},[151,876,877],{},[138,878,879,883,888,890],{},[156,880,881],{},[48,882,95],{},[156,884,561,885],{},[886,887],"span",{},[156,889,422],{},[156,891,892,893,895],{},"1–20 Order IDs; omit or ",[48,894,102],{}," for all active orders.",[44,897,898,899,902,903,906,907,910],{},"Answer: for one id — waiting \u002F SMS received with the code and every message \u002F not found. For several — one line per\norder and a summary (",[48,900,901],{},"Received: 1. Waiting: 2. Not found: 0.","). Statuses: ",[48,904,905],{},"TZ_NUM_WAIT"," — waiting for SMS,\n",[48,908,909],{},"TZ_NUM_ANSWER"," — SMS received.",[385,912,295],{"id":295},[44,914,915],{},"Close orders. A closed order without SMS is refunded; an order with an SMS is finished.",[132,917,918,930],{},[135,919,920],{},[138,921,922,924,926,928],{},[141,923,398],{},[141,925,401],{},[141,927,404],{},[141,929,407],{},[151,931,932],{},[138,933,934,938,942,944],{},[156,935,936],{},[48,937,95],{},[156,939,561,940],{},[886,941],{},[156,943,422],{},[156,945,892,946,948,949,952],{},[48,947,102],{}," closes ",[649,950,951],{},"all"," active orders.",[44,954,955,956,959,960,963,964,967,968,970],{},"Answer: one block per order — closed, or not closed with the code and its explanation. An order without SMS cannot be\nclosed during its guard interval (120 s from the order, 300 s for WhatsApp): that comes back as a refusal with\n",[48,957,958],{},"NO_COMPLETE_TZID",", the phone, service, country and ",[48,961,962],{},"guard_secs"," — wait that long and retry. Other codes:\n",[48,965,966],{},"ERROR_WRONG_TZID"," (unknown id), ",[48,969,736],{}," (the same order touched less than 5 s ago).",[385,972,88],{"id":88},[44,974,975],{},"Active Quick SMS orders and rentals with their ids — to recover after a crash or a lost context. No arguments.\nRead-only.",[44,977,493,978,981,982,89],{},[48,979,980],{},"Order ID [tzid] | number | service | country | status"," and\n",[48,983,984],{},"Receipt ID [tzid] | number | country | days | rental status | time left",[105,986,327],{"id":987},"rent",[44,989,990,991,993,994,998,999,1002,1003,1005],{},"A rental keeps a number for days and receives every SMS sent to it. ",[48,992,324],{}," reserves the price: the rental\nwaits up to ~20 minutes for its first SMS (status ",[995,996,997],"em",{},"waiting for first SMS","). The first real SMS confirms it and charges\nthe price; without one the rental closes and the reservation is released. Countries marked ",[48,1000,1001],{},"charged at once"," in\n",[48,1004,222],{}," are confirmed and charged immediately.",[385,1007,324],{"id":324},[44,1009,1010,1011,1013],{},"Rent a number. ",[649,1012,651],{}," (reservation, charged by the first SMS).",[132,1015,1016,1028],{},[135,1017,1018],{},[138,1019,1020,1022,1024,1026],{},[141,1021,398],{},[141,1023,401],{},[141,1025,404],{},[141,1027,407],{},[151,1029,1030,1046],{},[138,1031,1032,1036,1038,1040],{},[156,1033,1034],{},[48,1035,76],{},[156,1037,561],{},[156,1039,482],{},[156,1041,1042,487,1044,89],{},[48,1043,76],{},[48,1045,222],{},[138,1047,1048,1053,1055,1057],{},[156,1049,1050],{},[48,1051,1052],{},"days",[156,1054,561],{},[156,1056,482],{},[156,1058,1059],{},"One of the day tiers listed for that rental.",[44,1061,493,1062,1065],{},[48,1063,1064],{},"Receipt ID: [tzid]",", the number (without the country code), the price and whether it is reserved or charged,\nthe time left for the first SMS, and how to extend and cancel.",[44,1067,717,1068,1070,1071,1073,1074,429,1077,429,1079,429,1081,89],{},[48,1069,380],{}," (no rental number for that country\u002Fperiod — pick another from ",[48,1072,222],{},"),\n",[48,1075,1076],{},"UNDEFINED_DAYS",[48,1078,728],{},[48,1080,723],{},[48,1082,736],{},[385,1084,340],{"id":340},[44,1086,1087],{},"Rental inboxes, one API call. Read-only.",[132,1089,1090,1102],{},[135,1091,1092],{},[138,1093,1094,1096,1098,1100],{},[141,1095,398],{},[141,1097,401],{},[141,1099,404],{},[141,1101,407],{},[151,1103,1104],{},[138,1105,1106,1110,1114,1116],{},[156,1107,1108],{},[48,1109,98],{},[156,1111,561,1112],{},[886,1113],{},[156,1115,422],{},[156,1117,1118,1119,1121],{},"1–20 Receipt IDs; omit or ",[48,1120,102],{}," for all active rentals.",[44,1123,1124,1125,1128],{},"Answer: per rental — the number, status (waiting for first SMS \u002F active \u002F frozen), time left, the extension periods\nwith prices, and the messages newest first as ",[48,1126,1127],{},"sender: text",", with the code of the newest SMS.",[385,1130,354],{"id":354},[44,1132,1133,1134,1136],{},"Add days to a rental. ",[649,1135,651],{}," at once.",[132,1138,1139,1151],{},[135,1140,1141],{},[138,1142,1143,1145,1147,1149],{},[141,1144,398],{},[141,1146,401],{},[141,1148,404],{},[141,1150,407],{},[151,1152,1153,1167],{},[138,1154,1155,1160,1162,1164],{},[156,1156,1157],{},[48,1158,1159],{},"receiptId",[156,1161,561],{},[156,1163,482],{},[156,1165,1166],{},"Receipt ID.",[138,1168,1169,1173,1175,1177],{},[156,1170,1171],{},[48,1172,1052],{},[156,1174,561],{},[156,1176,482],{},[156,1178,1179,1180,1183,1184,1186,1187,1189],{},"One of ",[649,1181,1182],{},"this rental's"," extension periods, as listed by ",[48,1185,340],{}," (not a ",[48,1188,222],{}," tier).",[44,1191,1192,1193,1195],{},"Only a confirmed rental (after its first SMS) that was rented with extension can be extended. The tool reads the rental\nfirst and explains a refusal: not confirmed yet, cannot be extended, or ",[48,1194,1052],{},